# Workspace scratch that sits beside the project in /home/cdsw. It matters here
# because an AMP-deployed project clones this repository into /home/cdsw itself:
# in that layout these loose files land inside the working tree, where a stray
# `git add .` would commit notes, credentials and screenshots. On a manual clone
# they sit one level up and these rules simply never fire.
*.ipynb
!requirements.txt
*.txt
*.png
!docs/**/*.png
claude_launcher.sh
